    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The 2025 guidelines make closed-loop communication a formal, testable component of ACLS. Every order must complete a 3-step loop: sender gives a clear order - receiver acknowledges by repeating back - sender confirms receipt. This prevents errors from omission, misidentification, or misunderstanding."
     }
